### Project Preview / Description (For sharing or submission notes)

> **Log Analyzer & Anomaly Detector** is an automated production health-monitoring tool built in Python. It interfaces securely with the OpenAI API using custom system instructions to parse raw application logs (`app.log`), isolate critical failures (such as `OutOfMemoryError` heap exhaustion), and output precise, two-part incident summaries. Designed for rapid root-cause assessment, it minimizes downtime and helps reliability engineers instantly understand system impact.
